legend-lite
Copyright 2026 Legend Contributors

legend-lite is a clean-sheet implementation of the FINOS Legend platform's Pure language, its compiler and its
query engine, with Legend Query, Legend Studio and DataCube apps over it. Its compiler and engine are designed and
written anew; it takes FINOS Legend's legend-pure (https://github.com/finos/legend-pure) and legend-engine
(https://github.com/finos/legend-engine) as its specification -- their grammar, typing rules, semantics and
observable behaviour -- and tests itself against their published test suites and against answers recorded from
them. Its apps take FINOS Legend's legend-studio (https://github.com/finos/legend-studio) as the specification of
how they look and behave. Its debt to all three is the whole of what it implements.

