FINOS Legend
================================================================================

This product includes material taken or derived from legend-pure, legend-engine and legend-studio, licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0:

  From legend-pure and legend-engine (the release pinned in release.MODULE.bazel):
  - core/src/main/resources/com/legend/builtin/prelude.pure: Pure class, enumeration, profile and function
    declarations copied verbatim from their .pure sources (each section names its upstream file), generated by
    //spec:gen_prelude. It is compiled into legend-lite's compiler and its WebAssembly planner.
  - Function signatures, registry names and import lists extracted from them by the generators in spec/:
    core/src/main/java/com/legend/builtin/Pure.java, DynaFn.java, core/src/main/java/com/legend/compiler/
    CoreImports.java, core/src/main/resources/com/legend/builtin/engine-handlers.tsv and native-claims.tsv.
  - legend-engine's H2 connection defaults (core/src/main/java/com/legend/exec/H2Settings.java) and its classifier
    path map (sdlc-server/data/classifier-paths.json).
  - Test fixtures: parser-equivalence/src/test/resources/composition-pct-stripped.pure and
    engine-grammar-fixtures.jsonl.

  From legend-studio (commit 821c74c):
  - Its colour tokens, type colours and type icons (legend-art/src/tokens.css, icons.css, type-icon.ts).
  - Its Pure Monarch tokenizer, language configuration and editor themes (studio/src/ui/pure-language.ts) and its
    copy of the GitHub VS Code light theme's colours (studio/src/ui/github-light-colors.ts; MIT, see
    THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).
  - The look and layout of Legend Query, Legend Studio and DataCube, restyled after its stylesheets
    (query/src/ui/app.css, studio/src/ui/app.css, datacube/src/theme.css).

